{
 "_comment": "The chains this repo measures directly (scripts/chain_probe.py), across every VM family. Selection: the union of the top chains by DEX volume, stablecoin float, TVL and transaction count in the 2026-10-09 census (scripts/chain_census.py), plus every family the census cannot count transactions for (UTXO, ledgers, Move, Cosmos), so that 'high activity' is measured rather than inferred from DeFi alone. Identities: `ids.defillama` is DefiLlama's display name, `ids.llama_key` its internal chain key (also the coins-API prefix, inferred from single-chain protocols by chain_census.py and checked there), `ids.growthepie` / `ids.l2beat` / `ids.blockchair` the other sources' keys. Endpoints are a first choice only: the EVM adapter falls back to chainlist and accepts an endpoint only after it answers the right chain id and serves eth_getLogs. Census-only chains (no adapter yet) are listed under `census_only` so the gap is visible. `why` is the reason a chain is on the list, not a measurement; the numbers live in the census.",
